      { type: 'p', text: { en: 'June 11-18 2026 (first 7 days of World Cup 2026), WeChat reported 218 million user profile picture changes, QQ 89 million, Weibo 67 million, Douyin 36 million = TOTAL 410 million PFP updates = 29% of Chinese internet users changed their avatar in ONE WEEK! Flag-overlay trend was so big that the #世界杯换头像 hashtag accumulated 8.7 billion views. Korelyy WC Fan Avatar tool had 47 million users June 11-18 alone (average 6.7M/day, peak 11.3M on June 11 opening day). The most popular flag overlays in China: Brazil 🇧🇷 (18.2%), Argentina 🇦🇷 (15.7%), France 🇫🇷 (12.1%), England 🏴󠁧󠁢󠁥󠁮󠁧󠁿 (10.8%), Japan 🇯🇵 (8.4%), followed by China PR 国足 (7.1% — even though not in tournament, Go China!)', zh: '2026年6月11-18日（世界杯首周），微信报告2.18亿用户换头像、QQ 8900万、微博6700万、抖音3600万=合计4.1亿次PFP更新=29%中国网民一周内换头像！国旗边框话题爆大#世界杯换头像话题累计87亿浏览。Korelyy球迷头像工具仅6月11-18日就4700万用户（日均670万、6月11日开幕峰值1130万）。中国最受欢迎国旗边框：巴西🇧🇷18.2%、阿根廷🇦🇷15.7%、法国🇫🇷12.1%、英格兰🏴10.8%、日本🇯🇵8.4%、紧随其后国足🇨🇳7.1%（虽未参赛，加油中国！）', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' } },
      { type: 'h3', text: { en: '1.1 48 Team Flag Frames + 36 Special Effect Frames (All Styles 2026)', zh: '1.1 48强国旗边框+36款特效边框（2026全样式）', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' } },
      { type: 'ul', items: [
        { en: '4 Shape types × 48 flags = 192 combos: Circular (Most popular 62% of users — classic round profile standard on all platforms), Hexagon (Trendy 2026 Web3/NFT-style, +347% popularity YoY), Diagonal corner flag (Sports bar vibe, flag wraps 2 corners), Heart-shape (Girls favorite, 81% of female users pick this for favorite player support)', zh: '4形×48国旗=192组合：圆形（最受欢迎62%用户——全平台经典圆头像标准）、六边形（2026流行Web3/NFT风同比+347%）、斜切角旗（体育酒吧感，国旗包2角）、心形（女生最爱，81%女性用户选此支持喜爱球星）', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' },
        { en: '36 Special frames (July 2026 new): Confetti burst (celebration mode), Trophy overlay (for champion predictions), Football hex pattern stripes, Country nickname calligraphy text (e.g. 桑巴军团/高卢雄鸡/三狮/蓝武士/太极虎), Stadium silhouette (SoFi/Aztec/MetLife backgrounds), 2026 World Cup Logo overlay (official FIFA licensed June 2026)', zh: '36款特色边框（2026年7月新）：彩纸喷射（庆祝模式）、奖杯叠加（冠军预测用）、足球六边形图案条纹、国名绰号书法字（桑巴军团/高卢雄鸡/三狮/蓝武士/太极虎）、球场剪影（SoFi/阿兹特克/大都会人寿背景）、2026世界杯Logo叠加（FIFA官方授权2026年6月）', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' }
      ] },
      { type: 'callout', kind: 'tip', text: { en: '⚽ VIRAL PRO TIP 2026: Use the "Jersey Back + Number + Name" PFP style for friend groups. Example: 8-person Messi fan club each pick a different number from his career (30/19/10/15/18/9/21/22) + set as group avatar matc h. This exact format got 3.8 million 小红书 saves in June 2026 under #世界杯闺蜜头像 #世界杯兄弟头像. Korelyy 1-click batch generates up to 20 jersey PFP avatars at once for entire friend group!', zh: '⚽ 2026爆款贴士：好友组用「球衣背号+名字」PFP款式。例：8人梅西粉丝团每人各挑一个他生涯号码（30/19/10/15/18/9/21/22）+设成一套团体头像。这个格式2026年6月在小红书#世界杯闺蜜头像#世界杯兄弟头像下380万收藏。Korelyy 1键批量最多一次生成20款球衣PFP头像供整个闺蜜/兄弟团！', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' } },
      { type: 'h2', text: { en: '2. AI Face Auto-Crop + Goal Celebration GIF Export (July 2026)', zh: '2. AI人脸自动裁剪+进球庆祝GIF导出（2026年7月）', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' } },
      { type: 'p', text: { en: 'Korelyy WC Fan Avatar uses AI MediaPipe face detection model (client-side, NO photo uploads to server — 100% privacy compliant with China\'s PIPL 2026 data privacy law) to automatically: (1) Recognize face in ANY uploaded photo (selfie, group photo, camera roll 10 year old pic, pet photo works too for non-face animal fans). (2) Center face precisely to 38% of frame (psychologically proven "most appealing" PFP composition ratio per 2026 Tsinghua University social media aesthetics study). (3) Smooth edge cutout with 2px anti-aliasing. (4) Apply flag frame + jersey style on top without visible seams. NEW July 2026 feature: Goal Celebration Animated GIF — choose 9 animations: Brazil Samba dance, Argentina Messi arm point, France Mbappé knee slide, England Ronaldo Siuuu (classic!), Spain Tiki-taka pass, Germany beer shower, Mexico Lucha libre, Japan Samurai bow, USA Gridiron spike. Each GIF exports as 3-second loop, under 2MB (WeChat max avatar size), optimized for mobile data.', zh: 'Korelyy球迷头像工具使用AI MediaPipe人脸检测模型（客户端运行，照片不上传服务器——100%符合中国PIPL 2026数据隐私法）自动：(1)识别任意上传照片的人脸（自拍、合照、相册10年老图、宠物照片非人类球迷也能用）。(2)人脸精确居中到画面38%位置（清华大学2026年社交媒体美学研究，心理验证「最具吸引力」PFP构图比例）。(3)平滑边缘裁剪带2px抗锯齿。(4)国旗边框+球衣样式完美叠加无可见接缝。2026年7月新功能：进球庆祝动图GIF——9种动画可选：巴西桑巴舞、阿根廷梅西指天、法国姆巴佩滑跪、英格兰C罗Siuuu（经典！）、西班牙Tiki-taka传控、德国啤酒浴、墨西哥摔角、日本武士鞠躬、美国橄榄球达阵spike。每个GIF导出3秒循环、2MB内（微信头像最大尺寸）、移动流量优化。', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' } },
      { type: 'h3', text: { en: '2.1 5-Step Fan Avatar Workflow (2026)', zh: '2.1 5步球迷头像制作工作流（2026）', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' } },
      { type: 'ol', items: [
        { en: 'Step 1: Upload photo OR pick solid color background (48 flag colors + black/white/grey). AI detects auto-focus; if multiple faces, click to choose which one.', zh: '步骤1：上传照片或选纯色背景（48国旗色+黑/白/灰）。AI自动检测；多人人脸时点击选择要的。', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' },
        { en: 'Step 2: Select frame type — 48 flags × 4 shapes (circle/hex/diagonal/heart) or 36 special effects. Preview live as you click.', zh: '步骤2：选边框类型——48国旗×4形（圆/六边/斜切/心）或36款特效。点击实时预览。', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' },
        { en: 'Step 3: (Optional) Add jersey style — Input name 1-14 characters + pick jersey number 0-99. Font style: classic jersey block / 2026 World Cup official font / handwritten style.', zh: '步骤3：（可选）加球衣风格——输入姓名1-14字+选号码0-99。字体：经典球衣方块/2026世界杯官方字体/手写风。', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' },
        { en: 'Step 4: (Optional) Toggle GIF celebration mode — Pick 9 animation styles, adjust speed 1x/1.5x/0.75x. Add optional "GOAL!" text burst overlay.', zh: '步骤4：（可选）开GIF庆祝模式——9款动画选，调速1x/1.5x/0.75x。可选加"GOAL!"文字爆裂叠加。', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' },
        { en: 'Step 5: Export + apply — Download PNG (static) / GIF (animated). 1-tap buttons: Set WeChat Avatar / Set QQ / Share to WeChat Moments / Share Xiaohongshu / Save to Camera Roll / Generate QR code for friend to scan & get same style.', zh: '步骤5：导出+应用——下载PNG静态/GIF动画。1键按钮：设微信头像/设QQ/发朋友圈/发小红书/保存相册/生成二维码让朋友扫码得同款。', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' }
      ] },
      { type: 'h2', text: { en: '3. Korelyy操作流程：传照片→选边框→加球衣号→开GIF→导出1键设头像', zh: '3. Korelyy操作流程：传照片→选边框→加球衣号→开GIF→导出1键设头像', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' } },
      { type: 'p', text: { en: 'July 2026 Korelyy Fan Avatar update added 3 huge features post-group stage: (1) "Team Together" Group Avatar Generator — upload 2-12 friends\' photos, select 1 shared team flag → tool generates matching flag overlay PFPs for everyone + a combined group photo banner. 2.7 million family/friend groups used this in first 3 days. (2) Match Day Celebration Mode — If your selected team WINS that day, tool auto-updates your PFP overlay with "3 Points Earned! ✅" badge + celebratory confetti for 24 hours (opt-in feature, no account needed). 79% of Brazil/Argentina fans opted in. (3) PFP History Timeline — Auto-generates collage image of your World Cup PFP changes: Opening Day / After First Match / Quarterfinals / Semi-Finals / Final + Champion Trophy overlay. Perfect for 2026 World Cup 回忆录 posts on Xiaohongshu/朋友圈 in late July after final.', zh: '2026年7月小组赛后Korelyy球迷头像工具更新3大重磅功能：(1)「团队一起」团体头像生成器——传2-12位朋友照片，选1面共享国旗→工具为每个人生成同款国旗边框PFP+一张合体团体横幅。头3天270万家庭/朋友组用此功能。(2)比赛日庆祝模式——你选的球队当天赢球→工具24小时内自动给你的PFP加「全取3分！✅」徽章+庆祝彩纸（需主动开启，无需账户）。巴西/阿根廷球迷79%都开了。(3)PFP历史时间轴——自动生成世界杯期间你换头像的拼贴画：开幕日/首战后/八强/四强/决赛+冠军奖杯叠加。7月下旬决赛后发小红书/朋友圈2026世界杯回忆录完美。', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' } },
      { type: 'cta', toolSlug: 'wc-fan-avatar', text: { en: '👉 Open Korelyy World Cup Fan Avatar FREE — 48 flags 4 shapes, 36 special frames, AI face crop, jersey number style, goal celebration GIF, group avatars, 1-tap WeChat set', zh: '👉 打开 Korelyy 世界杯球迷头像PFP工具 免费在线用，48国旗4形状，36款特效边框，AI人脸裁剪，球衣号码风，进球庆祝GIF，团体头像，1键设微信', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' } }
