      { type: 'h2', text: { en: '3. Stoppage Time, VAR 2.0 & 7 More Important 2026 Rule Updates', zh: '3. 补时、VAR 2.0及其他7项重要2026新规', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' } },
      { type: 'p', text: { en: 'FIFA released stoppage time calculation guidelines February 2026 update, following 2022 Qatar\'s average of 5.2 minutes per half extra time. 2026 target: 7+ minutes average stoppage per match (each half shows exact "lost play time" publicly via stadium displays). Breakdown: goals/celebrations +1min each, substitutions +30sec each, VAR reviews +45sec actual, injuries +1min per player attended, penalty shootout preparation +2min (new). VAR Offside Semi-Automated 2.0 (introduced at 2025 Club World Cup and 2026 Euro) now uses 29 skeletal tracking points (up from 15) to create 3D "offside line" in 0.25 seconds (2022 took 75 seconds on average). Other rules: (1) goalkeeper cannot delay goal kicks > 6 seconds (caution + indirect free kick if repeated); (2) goal-line technology precision upgraded from 30mm to 1.5mm (FIFA tested Hawk-Eye Innovations at 2026 U20 World Cup, 0 disputes in 52 matches); (3) handball interpretation tightened: accidental handball in build-up to teammate\'s shot = disallowed goal if arm is in "unnatural position" (FIFA clarified 3 examples in circular 7/2026); (4) 8 captain armband types allowed (FIFA-approved campaign bands: No Discrimination, Save the Planet, etc. — not arbitrary political messages); (5) water/cooling breaks 3 minutes at 30 min and 75 min if wet-bulb globe temperature (WBGT) > 32°C at kickoff; (6) players can celebrate with fans in stands within 2.5m zone (yellow if beyond); (7) 10-yard minimum distance to ball during throw-in (new enforcement in 2026 — yellow card for repeat offenders after warning).', zh: 'FIFA在2026年2月更新了补时计算指南，继2022卡塔尔场均半场补时5.2分钟之后，2026目标场均补时≥7分钟（每半场精确「损失时间」在球场显示屏公示）。构成：进球/庆祝每次+1分钟、换人每次+30秒、VAR审核实际用时+45秒、受伤每次球员+1分钟、点球大战准备+2分钟（新增）。VAR越位半自动化2.0（2025世俱杯+2026欧洲杯正式引入）现用29个骨骼追踪点（从15点提升），0.25秒生成3D「越位线」（2022平均75秒）。其他规则：(1)门将开门球拖延>6秒（先警告，再犯→判间接任意球）；(2)门线技术精度从30mm升级到1.5mm（FIFA2026U20世界杯测Hawk-Eye，52场零争议）；(3)手球规则收紧：队友射门的「组织阶段」若出现无意手球、手臂处于「非自然位置」→进球无效（FIFA第7/2026号通知明确3种案例）；(4)允许8种队长袖标（FIFA批准的公益主题：反歧视、拯救地球等——禁止随意政治信息）；(5)开赛时湿球温度(WBGT)>32°C，在30和75分钟各进行3分钟补水/降温暂停；(6)球员可在2.5米区内与看台球迷庆祝（超区→黄牌）；(7)界外球时对方离球至少10码（2026新规强执行：先警告，再犯→黄牌）。', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' } },
      { type: 'cta', toolSlug: 'wc-scoreboard-simulator', text: { en: '👉 Open Korelyy World Cup Scoreboard Simulator FREE — toggle all 15 new 2026 rules (12 groups, 5 subs, 8 best 3rd, matrix matchups, stoppage +7min, VAR 2.0, 10,000-run Monte Carlo, printable bracket PNG export)', zh: '👉 打开 Korelyy 世界杯比分模拟器 免费在线用，切换15项2026新规（12组、5换人、8个第三、矩阵对阵、+7min补时、VAR2.0），1万次蒙特卡洛，可打印对阵图PNG导出', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' } }
